      "content": "wait, i'm a bit confused. if i can \"retain\" it in my \"unaided memory\" but i'm not allowed to \"disclose\" it, how am i supposed to actually use it? if i write a piece of code later that uses the same logic i learned there, isn't that technically disclosing the residual info by putting it into software? where is the line between what's in my head and what is \"disclosed\"?",
